  "id": "white-sheet-cake",
  "name": "White Sheet Cake",
  "subtitle": "A tender almond-flavored cake with glossy pecan frosting",
  "description": "Bake this simple sheet cake until set, cool it briefly, then finish it with warm almond frosting and chopped pecans.",
